Attribution note

The card information architecture, the reading-preset grouping, the
"expand while running / fold when done" process-panel policy, and several
live-verified Feishu card element shapes (collapsible_panel, column_set button
wrapping, form submit semantics) were informed by hermes-feishu-streaming-card
(https://github.com/baileyh8/hermes-feishu-streaming-card), which is MIT
licensed. This project shares no code with it.
